{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03965","headline":"兴庆池侍宴应制 · 刘宪","name":"兴庆池侍宴应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苍龙阙下天泉池，轩驾来游箫管吹。\n缘堤夏筱萦不散，冐水新荷卷复披。\n帐殿疑从画里出，楼船直在镜中移。\n自然东海神仙处，何用西崑辙迹疲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘宪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03965.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03965","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}